==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|что́-то}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-что-то.ogg}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|ru|pronoun|head=[[что́]][[-то]]|g=n|cat2=indefinite pronouns}}

# ''(indefinite pronoun)'' [[something]] ''(implies that one has a certain thing in mind, but does not know exactly what)''
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[видеть|ви́жу]] '''что́-то'''!|I see '''something'''!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ря́дом]] [[с]] '''че́м-то'''|next to '''something'''}}

====Usage notes====
The particle {{m|ru|-то}} imparts a sense of indefiniteness similar to English {{m|en|some}}. The forms of '''что-то''' are usually associated with affirmatives (like {{m|en|something}}), while {{m|ru|что́-нибудь}} is associated with questions and negatives (like {{m|en|anything}}).

====Declension====
{{ru-decl-noun-irreg-unc|n=none
